{"content_text": "{\"protocolSection\":{\"identificationModule\":{\"nctId\":\"NCT07816237\",\"orgStudyIdInfo\":{\"id\":\"VSA012-3001\"},\"organization\":{\"fullName\":\"Bisirna Therapeutics (Suzhou) Co., Ltd.\",\"class\":\"INDUSTRY\"},\"briefTitle\":\"A Multicenter, Randomized, Open-Label, Positive Controlled Phase III Study to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of VSA012 Injection in Participants With Paroxysmal Nocturnal Hemoglobinuria Who Are Naive to Complement Inhibitor Therapy\",\"officialTitle\":\"A Multicenter, Randomized, Open-Label, Positive Controlled Phase III Study to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of VSA012 Injection in Participants With Paroxysmal Nocturnal Hemoglobinuria Who Are Naive to Complement Inhibitor Therapy\"},\"statusModule\":{\"statusVerifiedDate\":\"2026-09\",\"overallStatus\":\"NOT_YET_RECRUITING\",\"expandedAccessInfo\":{\"hasExpandedAccess\":false},\"startDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2026-10-29\",\"type\":\"ESTIMATED\"},\"primaryCompletionDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2027-09-30\",\"type\":\"ESTIMATED\"},\"completionDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2029-12-31\",\"type\":\"ESTIMATED\"},\"studyFirstSubmitDate\":\"2026-09-04\",\"studyFirstSubmitQcDate\":\"2026-09-09\",\"studyFirstPostDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2026-09-11\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"},\"lastUpdateSubmitDate\":\"2026-09-09\",\"lastUpdatePostDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2026-09-11\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"}},\"sponsorCollaboratorsModule\":{\"responsibleParty\":{\"type\":\"SPONSOR\"},\"leadSponsor\":{\"name\":\"Bisirna Therapeutics (Suzhou) Co., Ltd.\",\"class\":\"INDUSTRY\"}},\"oversightModule\":{\"oversightHasDmc\":false,\"isFdaRegulatedDrug\":false,\"isFdaRegulatedDevice\":false},\"descriptionModule\":{\"briefSummary\":\"A study of the efficacy and safety of VSA012 Injection compared to eculizumab for 24 weeks in patients with PNH.\"},\"conditionsModule\":{\"conditions\":[\"Paroxysmal Nocturnal Hemoglobinuria, PNH\"]},\"designModule\":{\"studyType\":\"INTERVENTIONAL\",\"phases\":[\"PHASE3\"],\"designInfo\":{\"allocation\":\"RANDOMIZED\",\"interventionModel\":\"PARALLEL\",\"primaryPurpose\":\"TREATMENT\",\"maskingInfo\":{\"masking\":\"NONE\"}},\"enrollmentInfo\":{\"count\":70,\"type\":\"ESTIMATED\"}},\"armsInterventionsModule\":{\"armGroups\":[{\"label\":\"Cohort1\",\"type\":\"EXPERIMENTAL\",\"interventionNames\":[\"Drug: VSA012\"]},{\"label\":\"Cohort2\",\"type\":\"ACTIVE_COMPARATOR\",\"interventionNames\":[\"Drug: Eculizumab (Soliris®)\"]}],\"interventions\":[{\"type\":\"DRUG\",\"name\":\"VSA012\",\"description\":\"VSA012 Injection\",\"armGroupLabels\":[\"Cohort1\"]},{\"type\":\"DRUG\",\"name\":\"Eculizumab (Soliris®)\",\"description\":\"Eculizumab injection\",\"armGroupLabels\":[\"Cohort2\"]}]},\"outcomesModule\":{\"primaryOutcomes\":[{\"measure\":\"The proportion of patients with sustained hemoglobin levels ≥ 120 g/L among those without RBC transfusion (defined as no red blood cell infusion after W2 to W26).\",\"timeFrame\":\"between Week 2 and Week 26\"}],\"secondaryOutcomes\":[{\"measure\":\"Proportion of participants achieving a sustained increase from baseline in hemoglobin levels of ≥ 20 g/L assessed among those without RBC transfusion (defined as no red blood cell infusion after W2 to W26).\",\"timeFrame\":\"between Week 20 and Week 26\"},{\"measure\":\"The proportion of patients with hemolysis controlled (defined as LDH < 1.5 ULN) among those without RBC transfusion\",\"timeFrame\":\"between Week 20 and Week 26\"},{\"measure\":\"Change (Expressed as Percentages) in Hb level from baseline\",\"timeFrame\":\"between Week 20 and Week 26\"},{\"measure\":\"The proportion of patients without RBC transfusion\",\"timeFrame\":\"between Week 2 and Week 26\"},{\"measure\":\"Change in reticulocyte count from baseline\",\"timeFrame\":\"between Week 20 and Week 26\"},{\"measure\":\"Change in Total bilirubin count from baseline\",\"timeFrame\":\"between Week 20 and Week 26\"},{\"measure\":\"Change in FACIT-F score from baseline\",\"timeFrame\":\"between Week 20 and Week 26\"},{\"measure\":\"The Clinical BTH Rate\",\"timeFrame\":\"between Day 1 and Week 26\"},{\"measure\":\"The Major Adverse Vascular Events Rate\",\"timeFrame\":\"between Day 1 and Week 26\"},{\"measure\":\"Incidence and severity of AEs\",\"timeFrame\":\"between Day 1 and Week 26\"}],\"otherOutcomes\":[{\"measure\":\"Incidence and severity of AEs\",\"timeFrame\":\"between Day 1 and Week 26\"}]},\"eligibilityModule\":{\"eligibilityCriteria\":\"Inclusion Criteria:\\n\\n* Male and female participants ≥ 18 years of age and BMI ≥ 18.0 kg/m2 with a diagnosis of PNH confirmed by high-sensitivity flow cytometry with clone size≥10%.\\n* Mean hemoglobin level \\\\<100 g/L at screening.\\n* LDH \\\\> 1.5 x Upper Limit of Normal (ULN) at screening.\\n* Vaccination against Neisseria meningitidis infection is required prior to the\\n* start of study treatment. If not received previously, vaccination against\\n* Streptococcus pneumoniae and Haemophilus influenzae infections should be given.\\n\\nExclusion Criteria:\\n\\n* Known or suspected hereditary or acquired complement deficiency;\\n* Presence or suspicion of a systemic active bacterial, viral, or fungal infection\\n* History of infection with capsular bacteria (e.g., meningococcus, pneumococcus, etc.)\\n* Patients with reticulocytes \\\\<100x10\\\\^9/L; platelets \\\\<30x10\\\\^9/L; neutrophils \\\\<0.5x10\\\\^9/L.\\n* Positive of HIV, HBsAg or HCVAb.\\n* History of recurrent invasive infections caused by encapsulated organisms,e.g. meningococcus or pneumococcus.\\n* Previous splenectomy.\\n* A history of malignancy within 5 years before screening\",\"healthyVolunteers\":false,\"sex\":\"ALL\",\"minimumAge\":\"18 Years\",\"maximumAge\":\"75 Years\",\"stdAges\":[\"ADULT\",\"OLDER_ADULT\"]},\"contactsLocationsModule\":{\"centralContacts\":[{\"name\":\"Charlene Si\",\"role\":\"CONTACT\",\"phone\":\"+86-021-6107 5030\",\"email\":\"charlene.si@bisirna.com\"}],\"locations\":[{\"facility\":\"Peking Union Medical College Hospital\",\"city\":\"Beijing\",\"state\":\"Beijing Municipality\",\"country\":\"China\",\"contacts\":[{\"name\":\"Bing Han\",\"role\":\"CONTACT\",\"phone\":\"010-69151188\",\"email\":\"Hanbing-li@sina.com.cn\"}],\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":39.9075,\"lon\":116.39723}},{\"facility\":\"Jilin\",\"city\":\"Jilin City\",\"state\":\"Changchun\",\"country\":\"China\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":43.84652,\"lon\":126.5608}},{\"facility\":\"Quanzhou\",\"city\":\"Quanzhou\",\"state\":\"Fujian\",\"country\":\"China\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":24.91389,\"lon\":118.58583}},{\"facility\":\"Guangzhou\",\"city\":\"Guangzhou\",\"state\":\"Guangdong\",\"country\":\"China\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":23.11667,\"lon\":113.25}},{\"facility\":\"Nanning\",\"city\":\"Nanning\",\"state\":\"Guangxi\",\"country\":\"China\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":22.81667,\"lon\":108.31667}},{\"facility\":\"Ha'erbin\",\"city\":\"Harbin\",\"state\":\"Heilongjiang\",\"country\":\"China\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":45.75,\"lon\":126.65}},{\"facility\":\"Zhengzhou\",\"city\":\"Zhengzhou\",\"state\":\"Henan\",\"country\":\"China\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":34.75778,\"lon\":113.64861}},{\"facility\":\"Wuhan\",\"city\":\"Wuhan\",\"state\":\"Hubei\",\"country\":\"China\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":30.58333,\"lon\":114.26667}},{\"facility\":\"Changsha\",\"city\":\"Changsha\",\"state\":\"Hunan\",\"country\":\"China\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":28.19874,\"lon\":112.97087}},{\"facility\":\"Nantong\",\"city\":\"Nantong\",\"state\":\"Jiangsu\",\"country\":\"China\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":32.03028,\"lon\":120.87472}},{\"facility\":\"Xi'an\",\"city\":\"Xi’an\",\"state\":\"Shanxi\",\"country\":\"China\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":35.99785,\"lon\":113.52486}},{\"facility\":\"Chengdu\",\"city\":\"Chengdu\",\"state\":\"Sichuan\",\"country\":\"China\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":30.66667,\"lon\":104.06667}},{\"facility\":\"Institute of Hematology, Chinese Academy of Medical Sciences\",\"city\":\"Tianjin\",\"state\":\"Tianjin Municipality\",\"country\":\"China\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":39.14222,\"lon\":117.17667}},{\"facility\":\"The First Affiliated Hospital of Zhejiang University School of Medicine\",\"city\":\"Hangzhou\",\"state\":\"Zhejiang\",\"country\":\"China\",\"contacts\":[{\"name\":\"Hongyan Tong\",\"role\":\"CONTACT\",\"phone\":\"0571-87236114\",\"email\":\"hongyantong@aliyun.com\"}],\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":30.29365,\"lon\":120.16142}}]},\"ipdSharingStatementModule\":{\"ipdSharing\":\"UNDECIDED\"}},\"derivedSection\":{\"miscInfoModule\":{\"versionHolder\":\"2026-09-18\"},\"conditionBrowseModule\":{\"meshes\":[{\"id\":\"D006457\",\"term\":\"Hemoglobinuria, Paroxysmal\"}],\"ancestors\":[{\"id\":\"D000743\",\"term\":\"Anemia, Hemolytic\"},{\"id\":\"D000740\",\"term\":\"Anemia\"},{\"id\":\"D006402\",\"term\":\"Hematologic Diseases\"},{\"id\":\"D006425\",\"term\":\"Hemic and Lymphatic Diseases\"},{\"id\":\"D009190\",\"term\":\"Myelodysplastic Syndromes\"},{\"id\":\"D001855\",\"term\":\"Bone Marrow Diseases\"}]},\"interventionBrowseModule\":{\"meshes\":[{\"id\":\"C481642\",\"term\":\"eculizumab\"}]}},\"hasResults\":false}", "media_type": "application/json", "text_derivation": {"extractor_version": "stdlib-json-object-slice-v1", "method": "ctgov-study-json-v1", "raw_asset": {"byte_size": 482886, "media_type": "application/json", "relative_path": "evidence/raw/sha256/c0/c06baeb7b91589dca7ed33009ed82e276093b1e4e61a703b4a414a93af3f4123.bin", "sha256": "c06baeb7b91589dca7ed33009ed82e276093b1e4e61a703b4a414a93af3f4123"}, "record_selector": {"nct_id": "NCT07816237", "study_index": 5}, "schema_version": "1.0", "text_sha256": "25176c557670e0feaf66e119fd7572689b0758e810c2b069ae5089341fd15cde"}}